WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Two languages. One clear view.
[Soft electronic music]

00:02.000 --> 00:05.000
Paste the opening passage of Moby-Dick and select French.

00:05.000 --> 00:06.000
Translate the passage.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
The original and French translation appear side by side.

00:09.000 --> 00:14.000
Compare the aligned sentences without switching views.

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
Edit the first French sentence with the original still in view.

00:18.000 --> 00:20.000 --> 00:23.500
[The letter A morphs into hiragana み, then the Shiroko logo.]

00:23.500 --> 00:26.000
Shiroko. Every sentence. Side by side.
translate.shiroko.tools
